  {
    "speaker": "結華の友達１",
    "text": "三峰ちゃんお疲れ～",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005010050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "お疲れお疲れー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charCategory": "stand_fix",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "007",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100700501/1007005010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "結華の友達２",
    "text": "ねーこの後予定どう？\r\nケーキかパフェ食べようって話してたんだけどさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005010060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あーごめーん……！\r\n今日バイト……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close6",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700501/1007005010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "結華の友達２",
    "text": "嘘！？\r\nあれ、いつもシフト月曜だっけ！？",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "結華の友達１",
    "text": "違う違う、三峰ちゃんは単発──……だったよね？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005010070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そうそう\r\nもともと予定なかったんだけどさぁ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700501/1007005010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005010080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──この間一目惚れしちゃった服があって\r\nいるのよ、お金が",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700501/1007005010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "結華の友達２",
    "text": "あーね……！\r\nそれは仕方ないね……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "結華の友達１",
    "text": "ぜひ射止めて\r\nその一目惚れの彼を",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005010090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あは、彼なんかい",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close6",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700501/1007005010090"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0885",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "結華の友達２",
    "text": "てか三峰ちゃんさぁ、定職就く気ないの？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005010100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ちょ、人をプー太郎みたいに",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100700501/1007005010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "結華の友達２",
    "text": "うちのバイト先人探してるよ？\r\n輪っか状の揚げ菓子を売ってるお店なんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "結華の友達１",
    "text": "謎にドーナツと言わないの何",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005010110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……んやー、ありがたいお申し出なのですが……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700501/1007005010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005010120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "色々体験できるから\r\n単発バイト、結構気に入ってるんだよね",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700501/1007005010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "結華の友達２",
    "text": "あーんそっかぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "1179",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005010130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──じゃ、そろそろ……！\r\nほんとごめんね！　また誘ってくれたら嬉しい！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100700501/1007005010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "結華の友達２",
    "text": "もちろん！\r\n三峰ちゃんと揚げ仲間になれるように頑張る！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005010140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あっ、そっちじゃなくて\r\nケーキかパフェの方だったんだけど！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700501/1007005010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "結華の友達２",
    "text": "わかってるよ～冗談～",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005010150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あはは、じゃあまたね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
